    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 3991484035128
    m_Localized: Click an ally to select it. Hover an enemy or a corpse to see its
      details.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3991484035129
    m_Localized: Click an ally in a white dashed ring to mercy kill it. Click elsewhere
