  - m_Id: 9846568841250
    m_Localized: '{0} {0:plural:ally|allies} ready to act. Click an ally to give
      orders.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841251
    m_Localized: Battle Log
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841252
    m_Localized: Corpse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841253
    m_Localized: '{0}''s Corpse'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841254
    m_Localized: Rises as spawn at the start of the next Enemy Phase. Does not act
      on the turn it rises.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841255
    m_Localized: Inherits HP {0}, ATK {1}, MOV {2}, with DEF 0 and melee attacks
      only. Before it rises, pull nearby allies back or brace for it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841256
    m_Localized: Ally
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841257
    m_Localized: Boss
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841258
    m_Localized: Spawn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841259
    m_Localized: Minion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841260
    m_Localized: HP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841261
    m_Localized: ATK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841262
    m_Localized: DEF
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841263
    m_Localized: MOV
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841264
    m_Localized: RNG
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841265
    m_Localized: Full-moon target. If it is within {0} hexes of the vampire and out
      of the light on the next enemy turn, it is devoured and rises as spawn. Move
      it out of range, stand it in light, or mercy-kill it to make the drain fail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841266
    m_Localized: It is safe where it stands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841267
    m_Localized: In light. Cannot be drained and does not rise if it falls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841268
    m_Localized: In the coffin. Wakes when the Moon reaches {0} (now {1}).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841269
    m_Localized: The full moon rises next enemy turn. If it devours its target it
      does not move that turn. If it misses, it attacks as usual.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841270
    m_Localized: Moon {0}/{1}. Fills every enemy turn and every time a unit dies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841271
    m_Localized: Just risen. Does not act this Enemy Phase.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841272
    m_Localized: 'Skills: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841273
    m_Localized: Recall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841274
    m_Localized: Finished acting this turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841275
    m_Localized: Cancel Mercy Kill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841276
    m_Localized: Mercy Kill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841277
    m_Localized: Wait
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841278
    m_Localized: Allies it kills do not rise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841279
    m_Localized: Sleeps in its coffin until the Moon reaches {0}. Cannot be attacked
      while asleep. Once awake it moves and attacks normally. On the enemy turn the
      Moon reaches {1}, it does not move and devours its chosen target if it is within
      {2} hexes and out of the light (instant kill, restores {3} HP). If there is
      no target or it got away, the drain fails and it moves and attacks as usual.
      Either way, the moon sets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841280
    m_Localized: "Inherited HP \xB7 ATK \xB7 MOV from {0}. DEF 0, melee only. Allies
      it kills rise as spawn."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841281
    m_Localized: Allies killed by the vampire or spawn leave a corpse that rises
      as spawn at the <b>start of the next Enemy Phase</b>. Spawn do not act on the
      turn they rise. Allies killed by skeletons do not rise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841282
    m_Localized: '<b>Coffin</b>: The vampire starts in its coffin and wakes when
      the Moon reaches {0}. It cannot be attacked while asleep.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841283
    m_Localized: '<b>Moon</b>: Fills by 1 at the start of each enemy turn and by
      1 for each unit that dies (ally or enemy). At {0} the moon is full.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841284
    m_Localized: '<b>Full-moon target</b>: If the next enemy turn brings the full
      moon, the nearest ally within {0} hexes of the vampire and out of the light
      becomes its target at the start of the ally turn, and the target does not change.
      If no one is in range then, there is no target, the moon stays full, and the
      vampire advances as usual.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841285
    m_Localized: '<b>Full-moon drain</b>: On the full-moon turn the vampire does
      not move, and devours its target if it is still within {0} hexes and out of
      the light. If the target is out of range, in light, or already dead, the drain
      fails and the vampire moves and attacks as usual. Either way, the Moon returns
      to 0.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841286
    m_Localized: '<b>Mercy kill</b>: An ally you mercy-kill within attack range rests
      without rising. Mercy-killing the full-moon target also makes the drain fail.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841287
    m_Localized: '<b>Light</b>: Bonfire hexes, the hexes around them, and hexes in
      sunlight. Allies in light cannot be targeted and do not rise if they fall.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841288
    m_Localized: "Spawn inherit the original's HP \xB7 ATK \xB7 MOV, with DEF 0 and
      melee attacks only. Skill upgrades are not inherited."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841289
    m_Localized: "Damage = ATK \u2212 DEF (minimum 1). No randomness. No counterattacks
      or attacks of opportunity."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841290
