  - m_Id: 9846568841320
    m_Localized: Main Menu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9846568841321
    m_Localized: Chapters
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841322
    m_Localized: Clear a chapter to open the next one and new units. Bonus objective
      rewards are paid once, the first time. Gold will not buy every upgrade, so
      choose your core units and invest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841323
    m_Localized: "Barracks \xB7 Upgrades"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841324
    m_Localized: "Upgrades apply to every unit of that type and cannot be undone.
      A unit can be upgraded after you clear the chapter that unlocks it. Spawn inherit
      only HP \xB7 ATK \xB7 MOV upgrades."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841325
    m_Localized: No unit types can be upgraded yet. Clear Chapter 1 to open peasant
      upgrades.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846568841326
