  - m_Id: 9846573035525
    m_Localized: Turn-based hex tactics. Soldiers felled by the vampire rise as spawn
      and attack their comrades. Hold the light, and send off the allies you cannot
      save.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846573035526
    m_Localized: Demo Battle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846573035527
    m_Localized: A single battle with every unit available. No upgrades.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846573035528
    m_Localized: Campaign
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 9846573035529
    m_Localized: From peasant levies to hunters. Each chapter unlocks new units,
      and gold buys upgrades.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 10777284898816
    m_Localized: IBM Plex Sans, Segoe UI, Helvetica Neue, Arial, Malgun Gothic, Apple
      SD Gothic Neo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 10777347813376
    m_Localized: Georgia, Times New Roman, Nanum Myeongjo, Batang, AppleMyungjo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7201578077006332005
  - m_Id: 51181313126400
    m_Localized: "Full-moon target \xB7 drained next enemy turn"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51181384429568
    m_Localized: safe for now
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51181384429569
    m_Localized: "In light \xB7 cannot be targeted"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51181384429570
    m_Localized: "Just risen \xB7 will not act this enemy phase"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51181384429571
    m_Localized: "In the coffin \xB7 wakes at moon {0}"
    m_Metadata:
